<title>BELGIUM: Belgian gas blast kills father, two children.</title>
<headline>Belgian gas blast kills father, two children.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A gas explosion destroyed a house in the Brussels suburb of Anderlecht, killing a father, his 15-year-old daughter and six-year-old son, the Belga news agency reported on Monday. Several other people were injured.</p>
</text>
